Nicola's parents followed police to the front of the home. Everything appeared eerily quiet. The curtains were drawn and the front door was locked. Police had no choice but to break it down. Inside, everything appeared to be in place. There were no signs of a break-in or a struggle. But as officers made their way from the front lounge room to the kitchen, they noticed something sticking out from the doorway of an adjoining utility room.
尼古拉的父母跟随警察来到屋前。一切显得异常安静。窗帘拉着，前门锁着。警察别无选择，只能破门而入。屋内，一切似乎都各就各位。没有闯入或挣扎的迹象。但当警察从前厅走向厨房时，他们注意到有什么东西从相邻杂物间的门口伸了出来。

