01:13:15.000 --> 01:14:10.000
Here. The stress of Nicola's death and the ongoing litigation took an enormous toll on the health of her parents, Barbara and Michael, who were both aged in their mid 50s. Within a two year period of the legal proceedings, Barbara suffered from a heart attack and Michael from a serious stroke. They missed Nicola immensely. Small things served as daily reminders from her favourite songs to the way she always buzzed in any patch of sun she could find. Barbara told Crime Watch When I sit out there, in my garden in the sunshine, I think I can see her there in the lounger. Nicola's sister Michelle looked after her parents while also trying to manage her own grief.
“这里”。尼古拉去世的压力和持续的诉讼对她父母芭芭拉和迈克尔的健康造成了巨大的伤害，他们都已年过半百。在法律程序进行的两年内，芭芭拉患上了心脏病，迈克尔患上了严重的中风。他们非常想念尼古拉。小事成了她每天的提醒，从她最喜欢的歌到她总是嗡嗡作响地寻找任何阳光斑点的方式。芭芭拉告诉《犯罪观察》：“当我坐在花园里的阳光下时，我想我能看到她躺在躺椅上。”尼古拉的妹妹米歇尔在照顾父母的同时，也试图管理自己的悲伤。

